      "timestamp_raw": "May 19, 2018 2:32:26 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "<p>Great conditions this year!!!!</p><p>No rainy day in April =&gt; Close to 100% sun (unfortunately we are close before running out of water and this in Austria!!! <img alt=\":(\" class=\"smile\" src=\"//storage.proboards.com/forum/images/smiley/sad.png\"/> ), extra ordinary warm (30 °C in the green house every day!)</p><p><br/></p><p>The result:</p><p><br/></p><p>(The plant is on the left side)</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/HDq5wV\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/954/27334035777_087833a8f0_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a></p><p><br/></p><p>The size:</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27erhzW\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/824/42158881192_03fccc3734_b.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>The comparison even with tall leucophyllas indicates the size...</p><p>... size wins!</p><p><br/></p><p><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/26cQypN\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/903/41484432244_b8d339bbdc_k.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a></p><p><br/></p><p>Cuttlings are available, just send me a PN.</p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p>",
      "body_text": "Great conditions this year!!!!\nNo rainy day in April => Close to 100% sun (unfortunately we are close before running out of water and this in Austria!!!\n), extra ordinary warm (30 °C in the green house every day!)\nThe result:\n(The plant is on the left side)\nThe size:\nThe comparison even with tall leucophyllas indicates the size...\n... size wins!\nCuttlings are available, just send me a PN.",
