1495_7061ed852e_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/25Vzpsg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Fledgling'</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27e2V9A\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/905/42154321502_74e3ccdb55_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27e2V9A\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Fledgling'</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24xtc5s\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/825/40393879510_8306b057d9_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24xtc5s\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. 'Fledgling'</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>This is the extent of pitchers of my own...<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27i8kU2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/968/42200646301_aca5cfea70_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27i8kU2\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. oreophila x flava rubricorpora \"Don's Red Tube\" Clone A</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24xt985\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/947/40393869570_3a450e4f31_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/24xt985\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. oreophila x flava rubricorpora \"Don's Red Tube\" Clone A</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27i8gCg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/908/42200631931_16b47b9e7c_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27i8gCg\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. oreophila x flava rubricorpora \"Don's Red Tube\" Clone B</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr<br/>At least I can take partial credit for this though<br/><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27i7sav\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://farm1.staticflickr.com/911/42200472271_bab246150d_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/></a><a href=\"https://flic.kr/p/27i7sav\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">S. purpurea heterophylla</a> by <a href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/127653455@N03/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">Hawken Carlton</a>, on Flickr",
      "body_text": "I can't take credit for the first two here, but at least I have something decent in the yard now...\nS. flava atropurpurea FCPE#1\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. flava atropurpurea FCPE#1\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nYou can see my scraggly collection still waiting to take off in the background...\nS. flava atropurpurea FCPE#1\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. flava atropurpurea FCPE#1\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. 'Fledgling'\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. 'Fledgling'\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. 'Fledgling'\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nThis is the extent of pitchers of my own...\nS. oreophila x flava rubricorpora \"Don's Red Tube\" Clone A\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. oreophila x flava rubricorpora \"Don's Red Tube\" Clone A\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nS. oreophila x flava rubricorpora \"Don's Red Tube\" Clone B\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr\nAt least I can take partial credit for this though\nS. purpurea heterophylla\nby\nHawken Carlton\n, on Flickr",
